# GitTrophy Authentication Configuration
# Generate a Personal Access Token (Classic) at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required Scopes:
#   - repo (Full control of repositories)
#   - write:discussion (Read and write discussions)
#   - workflow (if updating workflows)

GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_yourPersonalAccessTokenHere

# [DUAL-ACCOUNT MODE] Secondary Account Token (Bypass Galaxy Brain anti-cheat & Pair Extraordinaire)
# Account 2 (Helper) creates discussions / Co-authors; Account 1 answers and gets badges!
# Required Scopes: repo, write:discussion
HELPER_TOKEN=ghp_secondaryAccountTokenHere
